{"version":1,"content":"<p>克萊弗利（Cleverly）行政總裁尼古拉斯・維裏蒂在洛杉磯經營企業，已經在谷歌投放廣告七年。大約八個月前，他留意到谷歌搜索廣告出現一個反常現象：他每天預留約 2000 美元谷歌廣告預算，總有一部分花不完 —— 瀏覽、點擊廣告的流量不足，預算無法耗盡。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585940.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:36:44.683755+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:14:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:29:50.486658+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:29:50.486658+00:00","content_hash":"cc0d1f31b229c96a1016fbcf0d219947db61065ee6c3f70a0dbd1e03326abfd5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}